sequenceDiagram
  participant A as Auditor
  participant V as Verifier
  participant L as Ledger/storage
  participant R as Independent RPC
  A->>V: event/proof/manifest/anchor reference
  V->>V: schema + canonical SHA-256
  V->>L: tenant chain + manifest/proof
  L-->>V: immutable evidence
  V->>V: leaf/nodes/root + manifest hash
  opt authorized chain check
    V->>R: chain/address/batch/block
    R-->>V: fields + confirmations/reorg view
  end
  V-->>A: valid / invalid / incomplete / not_anchored / anchor_unconfirmed receipt
